        {
            "location": "453/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/TopPanel_/CharaName",
            "text": "編成[パーティー   ]",
            "zh": "编成[队伍   ]",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/TopPanel_/CharaName"
        },
        {
            "location": "454/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12A/Panel/Message",
            "text": "<color=green>【クラン編成】</color>は\n、貴方と共に\n戦うクランを選ぶ場所。\n\n今回は、最も簡単に、最強の\n布陣を作る方法を教える。",
            "zh": "<color=green>【库兰编成】</color>\n是挑选与你一同\n战斗的库兰的地方。\n\n这次我教你最省事、最强的\n布阵方法。",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12A/Panel/Message"
        },
        {
            "location": "455/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12A/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel",
            "text": "キャンセル",
            "zh": "取消",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12A/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel"
        },
        {
            "location": "456/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12A/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK",
            "text": "OK",
            "zh": "OK",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12A/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK"
        },
        {
            "location": "457/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12B/Panel/Message",
            "text": "<color=green>【おまかせ編成】</color>ボタンは\n今持っているクランの中から\n最強の組み合わせを自動で作る。\n\nこのボタンを押してみて。\n",
            "zh": "<color=green>【自动编成】</color>按钮会\n从现有的库兰中\n自动组出最强的组合。\n\n按一下这个按钮试试。\n",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12B/Panel/Message"
        },
        {
            "location": "458/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12B/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel",
            "text": "キャンセル",
            "zh": "取消",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12B/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel"
        },
        {
            "location": "459/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12B/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK",
            "text": "OK",
            "zh": "OK",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12B/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK"
        },
        {
            "location": "460/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12C/Panel/Message",
            "text": "組み合わせは、５つの中から\n好きなものを選べるけど、今回は\n<color=green>「ほどよいバランス編成」</color>を\n選んでみて。\n",
            "zh": "组合可以从五个里\n选你喜欢的，这次\n先选<color=green>“均衡编成”</color>试试。\n\n",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12C/Panel/Message"
        },
        {
            "location": "461/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12C/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel",
            "text": "キャンセル",
            "zh": "取消",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12C/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel"
        },
        {
            "location": "462/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12C/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK",
            "text": "OK",
            "zh": "OK",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12C/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK"
        },
        {
            "location": "463/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12D/Panel/Message",
            "text": "これで今後のバトルにも\n打ち勝てる強い布陣ができた。",
            "zh": "这样一来，之后战斗也能\n取胜的强力布阵就完成了。",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12D/Panel/Message"
        },
        {
            "location": "464/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12D/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel",
            "text": "キャンセル",
            "zh": "取消",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12D/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel"
        },
        {
            "location": "465/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12D/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK",
            "text": "OK",
            "zh": "OK",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12D/Panel/PicArea/RightButton/TextOK"
        },
        {
            "location": "466/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12E/Panel/Message",
            "text": "さて、これでだいたい\n全ての準備が整った感じ。\n\n一旦<color=green>【HOME】</color>に戻りましょ。\n",
            "zh": "好了，这样大致上\n所有准备都齐了。\n\n先回<color=green>【HOME】</color>吧。\n",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12E/Panel/Message"
        },
        {
            "location": "467/UI",
            "narrator": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12E/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel",
            "text": "キャンセル",
            "zh": "取消",
            "narrator_zh": "CuranFormationMenuCanvas2/Panel/Tutorial/TutorialCuran12E/Panel/PicArea/LeftButton/TextCancel"
        },
        {
            "location": "468/UI",
